{
  "02_002-b1": [
    {
      "id": "02_002-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "咳咳咳!",
      "script_text": "ゴホッ、ゴホッ、ゴホッ！",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0,
      "seconds": 1.5,
      "target": "片段2/分镜2"
    }
  ],
  "02_002-b2": [
    {
      "id": "02_002-b2",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "该死!找不到机会\n被追着跑了十多分钟!",
      "script_text": "くそっ！攻める隙がない！もう十分以上も追い回されてる！",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 2,
      "seconds": 5.5,
      "target": "片段2/分镜2"
    }
  ],
  "02_003-b1": [
    {
      "id": "02_003-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "inner",
      "source_text": "幸好这玩意体型大\n动作也大\n闪过他的攻击不算难",
      "script_text": "幸い、体がでかくて動きも大きい。攻撃をかわすのは難しくない。",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0.5,
      "seconds": 6.5,
      "target": "片段3/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "02_003-b2": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "seconds": 2.5,
      "script_text": "視野も広くなさそうだし。",
      "target": "片段3/分镜2"
    },
    {
      "start": 0.5,
      "seconds": 4,
      "script_text": "建物の間に隠れて、弱点さえ見つければ…",
      "target": "片段3/分镜3"
    }
  ],
  "03_001-b1": [
    {
      "id": "03_001-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "这就发现我了?",
      "script_text": "もう見つかったの？",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0.25,
      "seconds": 1.5,
      "target": "片段4/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "03_002-b1": [
    {
      "id": "03_002-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "?!!",
      "script_text": "!?",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0.25,
      "seconds": 0.5,
      "target": "片段4/分镜2"
    }
  ],
  "05_001-b1": [
    {
      "id": "05_001-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "这也太离谱了!\n你厌倦了捉迷藏,哈?",
      "script_text": "ありえないでしょ！かくれんぼに飽きたってわけ？",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 1,
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "target": "片段5/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "05_001-b2": [
    {
      "id": "05_001-b2",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "然后你就\n把整座城拆了",
      "script_text": "だからって、街を丸ごと壊すなんて！",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 5.5,
      "seconds": 3.0,
      "target": "片段5/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "05_002-b1": [
    {
      "id": "05_002-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "HEY!!",
      "script_text": "おい!!",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0.25,
      "seconds": 0.5,
      "target": "片段5/分镜2"
    }
  ],
  "05_002-b2": [
    {
      "id": "05_002-b2",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "看哪呢?\n傻大个!",
      "script_text": "どこ見てんの、デカブツ！",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 1,
      "seconds": 2.0,
      "target": "片段5/分镜2"
    }
  ],
  "06_002-b1": [
    {
      "id": "06_002-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "你过来呀!",
      "script_text": "ほら、こっちに来な！",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0.25,
      "seconds": 2.0,
      "target": "片段6/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "06_002-b2": [
    {
      "id": "06_002-b2",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "长翅膀的杂种",
      "script_text": "羽の生えたクソ野郎！",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 2.75,
      "seconds": 2.0,
      "target": "片段6/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "09_001-b1": [
    {
      "id": "09_001-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "inner",
      "source_text": "这身躯真是\n铜浇铁铸\n毫无破绽",
      "script_text": "この体、まるで鋼鉄の塊。まったく隙がない。",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0.5,
      "seconds": 4.5,
      "target": "片段8/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "09_001-b2": [
    {
      "id": "09_001-b2",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "inner",
      "source_text": "但任何生物都有弱点!",
      "script_text": "でも、生き物なら必ず弱点はある！",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 5,
      "seconds": 2.5,
      "target": "片段8/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "09_002-b1": [
    {
      "id": "09_002-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "inner",
      "source_text": "不能再拖下去了!",
      "script_text": "これ以上、長引かせられない！",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 7.5,
      "seconds": 2,
      "target": "片段8/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "09_002-b2": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "seconds": 1.5,
      "script_text": "どんな動物にも",
      "target": "片段8/分镜2"
    },
    {
      "start": 0,
      "seconds": 3.5,
      "script_text": "共通する弱点を、直接狙う。",
      "target": "片段9/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "10_001-b1": [
    {
      "id": "10_001-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "inner",
      "source_text": "那就是眼睛!",
      "script_text": "それは、目だ！",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 4,
      "seconds": 1.0,
      "target": "片段9/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "11_001-b1": [
    {
      "id": "11_001-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "inner",
      "source_text": "来尝尝这个!",
      "script_text": "これでも食らえ！",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0,
      "seconds": 1.5,
      "target": "片段9/分镜3"
    }
  ],
  "11_001-b2": [
    {
      "start": 1.5,
      "seconds": 2.5,
      "script_text": "かわせるもんなら、かわしてみなよ。",
      "target": "片段9/分镜3"
    },
    {
      "start": 0,
      "seconds": 1.5,
      "script_text": "デカブツ！",
      "target": "片段9/分镜4"
    }
  ],
  "11_003-b1": [
    {
      "id": "11_003-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "什么...?",
      "script_text": "何…？",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0.25,
      "seconds": 0.5,
      "target": "片段10/分镜2"
    }
  ],
  "12_002-b1": [
    {
      "id": "12_002-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "inner",
      "source_text": "居然可以变形\n全覆盖面甲?",
      "script_text": "変形して、顔全体を装甲で覆えるの？",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0.25,
      "seconds": 3.5,
      "target": "片段10/分镜5"
    }
  ],
  "12_002-b2": [
    {
      "id": "12_002-b2",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "inner",
      "source_text": "你他妈在逗我?",
      "script_text": "ふざけてんのかよ？",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 4,
      "seconds": 2.0,
      "target": "片段10/分镜5"
    }
  ],
  "12_003-b1": [
    {
      "start": 0,
      "seconds": 2.5,
      "script_text": "こいつ…硬いってもんじゃない！",
      "target": "片段11/分镜1"
    },
    {
      "start": 0,
      "seconds": 3.5,
      "script_text": "この硬さ、言葉じゃ言い表せない！",
      "target": "片段11/分镜2"
    }
  ],
  "12_003-b2": [
    {
      "start": 3.5,
      "seconds": 2,
      "script_text": "鉄の塊より硬いじゃん！",
      "target": "片段11/分镜2"
    },
    {
      "start": 0,
      "seconds": 1.5,
      "script_text": "何を食べたら、",
      "target": "片段11/分镜3"
    },
    {
      "start": 0,
      "seconds": 1.5,
      "script_text": "こんなに硬くなるの？",
      "target": "片段11/分镜4"
    }
  ],
  "14_001-b1": [
    {
      "id": "14_001-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "?!",
      "script_text": "!?",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0.25,
      "seconds": 0.5,
      "target": "片段12/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "14_002-b1": [
    {
      "start": 0.5,
      "seconds": 1,
      "script_text": "痛い…！",
      "target": "片段12/分镜2"
    },
    {
      "start": 0,
      "seconds": 4.5,
      "script_text": "でも、腕が歯の隙間に挟まってるだけでよかった。",
      "target": "片段12/分镜3"
    }
  ],
  "14_002-b2": [
    {
      "id": "14_002-b2",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "inner",
      "source_text": "但是再这样\n下去手臂会\n被扯断的!",
      "script_text": "でも、このままじゃ腕が引きちぎられる！",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0,
      "seconds": 3.5,
      "target": "片段12/分镜4"
    }
  ],
  "15_001-b1": [
    {
      "id": "15_001-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "我...我得\n赶紧拔出来...!",
      "script_text": "あ…早く引き抜かなきゃ…！",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0.5,
      "seconds": 2.5,
      "target": "片段13/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "15_001-b2": [
    {
      "id": "15_001-b2",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "就算弄断胳膊\n我也得先下来!",
      "script_text": "腕がちぎれても、先にここから降りなきゃ！",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 3.5,
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "target": "片段13/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "15_002-b1": [
    {
      "id": "15_002-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "EUK!!",
      "script_text": "うぐっ!!",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0,
      "seconds": 0.5,
      "target": "片段13/分镜3"
    }
  ],
  "16_003-b1": [
    {
      "id": "16_003-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "嗄哈!!",
      "script_text": "がはっ!!",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0,
      "seconds": 0.5,
      "target": "片段14/分镜2"
    }
  ],
  "16_003-b2": [
    {
      "id": "16_003-b2",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "咳咳咳!",
      "script_text": "ゴホッ、ゴホッ、ゴホッ！",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 1,
      "seconds": 1.5,
      "target": "片段14/分镜2"
    }
  ],
  "16_004-b1": [
    {
      "id": "16_004-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "呼...呼呜...\n这也太疼了",
      "script_text": "はぁ…ふぅ…痛すぎる。",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0.5,
      "seconds": 3.0,
      "target": "片段14/分镜3"
    }
  ],
  "17_001-b1": [
    {
      "id": "17_001-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "真难搞...",
      "script_text": "厄介だな…",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0.25,
      "seconds": 1.5,
      "target": "片段15/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "17_001-b2": [
    {
      "id": "17_001-b2",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "我本来就想看看\n它有多能打然后开溜的...",
      "script_text": "どれだけ強いか見て、さっさと逃げるつもりだったのに…",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 2,
      "seconds": 5.0,
      "target": "片段15/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "17_002-b1": [
    {
      "id": "17_002-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "inner",
      "source_text": "这么好斗的话\n就算逃跑它也会\n追上来吧",
      "script_text": "こんなに好戦的なら、逃げても追ってくるよね。",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0.25,
      "seconds": 4.0,
      "target": "片段16/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "17_002-b2": [
    {
      "start": 0.5,
      "seconds": 0.75,
      "script_text": "くそっ！",
      "target": "片段16/分镜2"
    },
    {
      "start": 0,
      "seconds": 4.25,
      "script_text": "ここで倒すしかなさそう。でも、どうすれば？",
      "target": "片段16/分镜3"
    }
  ],
  "18_001-b1": [
    {
      "id": "18_001-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "好吧...我们找到他\n也不是说抓不到他",
      "script_text": "まあ…見つけたんだし。捕まえられないってわけじゃないよ。",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0.25,
      "seconds": 5.5,
      "target": "片段17/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "18_001-b2": [
    {
      "id": "18_001-b2",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "参照它们的平均寿命\n这条龙应该还很小\n相对成年体来说\n还算好办",
      "script_text": "平均寿命から考えると、この竜はまだかなり幼いはず。成体に比べれば、まだ相手にしやすいよ。",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 6,
      "seconds": 8.0,
      "target": "片段17/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "18_002-b1": [
    {
      "id": "18_002-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "inner",
      "source_text": "......",
      "script_text": "……",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0.25,
      "seconds": 0.5,
      "target": "片段18/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "18_002-b2": [
    {
      "id": "18_002-b2",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "inner",
      "source_text": "还不是成年体?",
      "script_text": "まだ成体じゃないの？",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 1,
      "seconds": 1.5,
      "target": "片段18/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "18_003-b1": [
    {
      "start": 0.5,
      "seconds": 2.5,
      "script_text": "倒すのは無理そう…でも、",
      "target": "片段18/分镜2"
    },
    {
      "start": 0,
      "seconds": 4,
      "script_text": "こいつをほんの少しでもビビらせられたら…",
      "target": "片段18/分镜3"
    }
  ],
  "18_003-b2": [
    {
      "id": "18_003-b2",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "inner",
      "source_text": "这能行吗...?",
      "script_text": "うまくいくかな…？",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 4.5,
      "seconds": 1.5,
      "target": "片段18/分镜3"
    }
  ],
  "19_001-b1": [
    {
      "id": "19_001-b1",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "inner",
      "source_text": "不...没时间犹豫了!",
      "script_text": "いや…迷ってる時間はない！",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0.25,
      "seconds": 2.5,
      "target": "片段19/分镜1"
    }
  ],
  "19_001-b2": [
    {
      "id": "19_001-b2",
      "speaker": "青",
      "kind": "inner",
      "source_text": "放手一搏吧!",
      "script_text": "一か八か、やってやる！",
      "status": "mapped",
      "start": 0,
      "seconds": 2.0,
      "target": "片段19/分镜2"
    }
  ]
